{
  "$comment": "Collection policy after authenticated Discovery (2026-09-09). allow = business fields to capture from the site (values stored PRIVATE, unmasked). normalization rules keyed by field; 'trim' collapses whitespace runs, 'identity' preserves inner text. This file is the source of truth for collection.",
